{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ImageCustomFields\">Image Custom Fields</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Content Custom CustomField CustomFields Image ImageCustomFields Is On Other To ToDate User Users\">Image custom fields allow users to upload and attach pictures, photos, and other visual content to various forms throughout the system.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Image On To ToDate User Users\">Once created, these fields will appear on the forms you assign them to, enabling users to upload images directly within those forms.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Image Is On Other Receipt Receipts To ToDate\">Image fields are useful for attaching product photos, receipts, identification documents, or any other visual information relevant to your records.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Custom CustomField Image Is Label Name On To ToDate\">The name identifies each image custom field and will be displayed as the field label on forms.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Image Name Receipt To ToDate Type\">Choose descriptive names that clearly indicate what type of image should be uploaded, such as \"Product Photo\", \"Receipt Image\", or \"ID Document\".</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Placement\">Placement</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Placement\">Placement</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Edit Image Is To ToDate User Users\">Shows which forms include this image field, allowing users to upload images when creating or editing those specific records.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Image Rent To ToDate Type\">You can assign the same image field to multiple forms if you need the same type of image across different areas of the system.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "image-custom-fields"
}
